2026-07-27T08:33:03.6464711Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:33:03.6533959Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:33:03.6534714Z i /tmp/RtmpvRVxGC/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:33:03.6535213Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:33:03.6535829Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:33:03.6537075Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:33:03.6537986Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:33:03.6539216Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:33:03.6540112Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:33:03.6804329Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:33:03.6918703Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:33:03.7403205Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:33:03.7582034Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
